    "Use #pragma omp simd reduction over the tile dimension inside inner j-loop for vectorization",
    "Add restrict qualifiers on pointer parameters in force computation and write functions",
    "Parallelize both force tiling loop and position update with OpenMP schedule(static)",
    "Hoist body j coordinates into local variables before SIMD region"
  ]
